notes.content:
1.Introducing a new world map system, the world of the Dark Goddess is now open for the first time, allowing players to choose new levels to challenge and also to revisit and replay previously completed levels;

2.Adding 7 new Goddess skin cards, with this batch featuring a second-generation anime theme, which is a significant departure from previous styles, and we hope players will enjoy it;

3.Fixed some special effect response issues;

4.Fixed some translation issues on the interface;

5.Introduced a crystal purchase skin event, where players can directly use crystals to buy three new Goddess skins. These skins are only available during the event period and will become out of print and unobtainable after the event ends.

1.New Goddess Treasure Chest: Every 3 hours, you can draw a Goddess Treasure Chest once, and opening it will guarantee you a main character skin;

2.New Main Character Skin System: After equipping a skin, the main character card will be replaced with a brand-new image, and the corresponding avatar will also be replaced; Main character skins do not come with additional attributes, and will not disrupt the inherent balance of the game;

3.New 23 Main Character Skins: Skins have different qualities and probabilities, some skins have a maximum production limit, and some skins have a limited production time, which can be viewed in the game;

4.New Goddess Album System: You can view the introduction of all skins, but before you actually acquire them, all skins will be blurred to cover, hoping you will unlock your own skin as soon as possible!

5.Optimize Account Experience: All new players will be assigned an account password by default upon entering the game, which you can modify as needed later.

If everything goes smoothly, we will launch a brand new main character skin system in the game this weekend.

- Every 3 hours, you can draw a Goddess Treasure Chest once, and you will definitely get a main character skin after opening it;
- After equipping the skin, the main character card will be replaced with a brand new image, and the corresponding avatar will also be replaced;
- The main character skins do not come with additional attributes and will not disrupt the inherent balance of the game;
- The first phase will update 23 skins available for drawing, each with its own quality and probability, and we will ensure that the rarer the skin, the more ornamental value it has;
- All skins will enter the STEAM trading market in the next version, and can be freely traded, allowing players' game actions to have greater value;
- For more information about the skins, please look forward to this weekend's update. We hope to welcome a wonderful weekend together with the players.

